WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.980
ARTHUR BROOKS: Everybody wants to
know the one secret to happiness.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.110
And there sort of is,
and there sort of isn't.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.970
There isn't insofar as, look, it's a
whole body of literature and science.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.670
There's a whole panoply
of secrets to happiness.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.940
But it all funnels down, at
the very beginning at least,

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:24.900
to one big idea, which is studying
happiness, learning about happiness.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.460
You got to work for it.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.383
The secret to happiness
is working for happiness.

00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:31.800
I meet people all the time who
say, I wish I were happier.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.780
Wishing doesn't cut it.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.770
Wishing is no good.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.340
You got to work.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:40.320
That's why you're taking this class,
to do the work, and it will pay off.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.670
[MUSIC PLAYING]

